<title>UK: GMAC Australia sets A$100 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>GMAC Australia sets A$100 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GMAC AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    19.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.882   PAY DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LON/AMST  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A3	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 TAX PROVS STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
</text>
